  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_c6eb1764-b109-4e95-9ba2-9d0621f0e64b.png\"></p><p>这是一个库模组！如果你不是开发者，不用担心。它可能作为其他模组的依赖出现在你的整合包中。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_2158d9d6-4a3c-4bff-9dd9-81061aab7627.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/TxniLib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_410fddf2-ea88-4b14-90b3-e867e93d9ac3.png\"></p><p>如果你是开发者，你好！这个库是专门为配合我的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftemplate.txni.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">多版本模板模组</a>设计的，我用它来从一个代码库中同时发布适用于1.20和1.21版本的Forge和Fabric模组。除了我发现有用的随机内容外，这个模组主要包含平台和版本特定的实现，以减少在跨版本维护项目时重复的if/else代码。欢迎你使用它，但文档会在我有额外时间时提供。</p>",
